{"title":"2021 JMPSC Invitationals Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/a/9da95bb74f5c3b570aeabb95aadddd06d8ffd377.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2 + 5x = 4,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is some constant, has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> as a solution. What is the other solution?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> must be a solution, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/9/9e9fc102b5c351d46d77208c9eb499332b132769.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+5=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> must be true. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/35496101e151991fc3213a7472ade63fd75bdf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />. We plug this back into the original quadratic to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/a/aca309d57636557ebbe84bcb2b812576371d8d82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x-x^2=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />. We can solve this quadratic to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/8/d3818b42481a171d953bd6790c068d34809df183.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"17\" />. We are asked to find the 2nd solution so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/4/6c4c6c07150a0f6e56b0a6e198d1d19155dfe96c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~Grisham\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plug <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/817555099cf3c1ef68bd2e5b1f4bd27d48cbbb6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/6/32692f86b34761424acebad5fbc5f0df378ed747.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-5x+4=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/4/da4dd4cb8a20c38eea2a9d74bea0534834f5ec68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-4)(x-1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />, meaning the other solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/a/59abc64f014857766b7cbf2c69d25fd2f74f9c54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"55\" height=\"23\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/f/68f40b1e5cfdb4e4b37d0f5d1c57a5c893020e39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\linebreak$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"22\" />\n~Geometry285\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf519a3cde1b08a09590661ce67b7e0338ad6815.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ax^2+5x-4=0\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"17\" />Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/1/c01fd0d3a9236c5512163468e15f27e14385bfcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+5-4=0 \\implies a+1=0 \\implies a=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"338\" height=\"15\" />, therefore,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/3/323a6a127fb60f51b685345b4927af903cc31667.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-x^2+5x-4=0 \\implies (x-4)(x-1)=0\\]\" width=\"331\" height=\"20\" />Finally, we get the other root is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>- kante314 -\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can rearrange the equation to get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/3/be356dc91bffb62099edc8e8f033e1e3da25383a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2 + 5x - 4 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" />. Then, by Vieta's Formulas, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdc1698b558ff68c789e62d3a5b5ac06eac1bcc0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = -\\frac{4}{a}\\]\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/9/1b939429a887eaa57676ee0a59904df2b5f8b22e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1+x = -\\frac{5}{a},\\]\" width=\"96\" height=\"38\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is the second root of the quadratic. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> tells us that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/4/6c4c6c07150a0f6e56b0a6e198d1d19155dfe96c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" />. \n</p><p>~Mathdreams\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Invitationals Problems\">Other 2021 JMPSC Invitationals Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Invitationals Answer Key\">2021 JMPSC Invitationals Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JMPSC_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"JMPSC Problems and Solutions\">All JMPSC Problems and Solutions</a></li></ol>\n<p>The problems on this page are copyrighted by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://jmpsc.org\">Junior Mathematicians' Problem Solving Competition</a>. <span class=\"mw-valign-middle\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:JMPSC.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/120px-JMPSC.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/180px-JMPSC.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/a/ab/JMPSC.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017135328\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 150/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 183/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4595/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.014      1 Template:JMPSC_Notice\n100.00%    9.014      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21628:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017135328 and revision id 158243. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}